# Visual diff pipeline: ignore generated artifacts.
#
# The Controller-approved baselines under reference-images/ are
# NOT yet tracked here. After Phase 1 sign-off the Controller
# will run `pnpm visual:install-baselines` and explicitly
# commit the contents of reference-images/ — see the README in
# that directory and scripts/visual/install-baselines.mjs.
# Until then, the subagent-installer is local-only and the
# Playwright suite will fail loudly if a baseline is missing.
frontend/tests/visual/__artifacts__/
frontend/tests/visual/__screenshots__/reference-images/*.png
!frontend/tests/visual/__screenshots__/reference-images/README.md
!frontend/tests/visual/__screenshots__/reference-images/INSTALL-MANIFEST.json

.worktrees/

*.log
pnpm-debug.log*
npm-debug.log*
